# Keep secrets and local clutter out of the build context. Dockerfile.api does
# `COPY aberowlapi/ /app/aberowlapi/`, which previously baked
# aberowlapi/.aberowl_secret_key into every published worker image.
**/.aberowl_secret_key
**/*.secret_key
# The registry seed is runtime state, not source, and is gitignored. Without
# this, a build on a machine that happens to hold one copies it into the image.
**/servers.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key
.env
env_files/

.git/
.github/
paper/
results/
experiments/
tests/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
*.bak-rename
*~
CLAUDE.local.md*
